# The browser opens on Pictures, a page at a time.
expect Nonograms
expect Picture puzzles
expect 18 puzzles
expect House
expect Not started · 5×5 · Easy
expect 1 of 4
expect-missing Earlier
clean
shot nonograms-browser
tap-id next-page
expect 2 of 4
expect-missing House
tap-id previous-page
expect House
tap Patterns
wait-for Pattern puzzles
expect 60 puzzles
clean
shot nonograms-patterns
tap Photos
wait-for No photo puzzles yet
expect kobo nonograms push
clean
shot nonograms-photos-empty
# Add photos explains the push command, and Back returns to the shelf.
tap Add photos
expect Send photos
expect --size N
clean
shot nonograms-add-photos
tap-id 4294967295
expect No photo puzzles yet
tap Pictures
wait-for Picture puzzles
# How to play runs over pages and comes back to the shelf.
tap How to play
expect Use the clues to fill the picture
wait 250
clean
shot nonograms-help
tap-id help-next
expect-missing Use the clues to fill the picture
clean
shot nonograms-help-2
tap-id help-previous
expect Use the clues to fill the picture
tap Back
expect Picture puzzles
tap House
wait-for-id more
wait-for-id board.cell.24
expect 2 2
# Undo stays greyed out until there is something to take back.
expect 0/25
# One tap fills, a second crosses out, a third clears.
tap-id board.cell.2
wait-idle
expect Row 1, column 3, filled
expect 1/25
tap-id board.cell.0
tap-id board.cell.0
expect Row 1, column 1, crossed out
tap-id board.cell.0
expect Row 1, column 1, empty
tap-id undo
expect Row 1, column 1, crossed out
tap-id undo
tap-id undo
expect Row 1, column 1, empty
expect Row 1, column 3, filled
# A clue opens whole on its own screen.
tap-id board.column.2
expect Column 3
shot nonograms-clue
tap-id resume
tap-id more
wait-for Guided
expect Restart puzzle
expect Puzzles
clean
shot nonograms-options
tap Guided
tap Run entry
wait-idle
clean
shot nonograms-options-on
tap Back
wait-idle
# Run entry is on, so two taps fill the whole third row.
tap-id board.cell.10
expect Tap the other end of the run
tap-id board.cell.14
wait-idle
expect Row 3, column 5, filled
expect 6/25
shot nonograms-play
# A run that turns a corner is refused.
tap-id board.cell.15
tap-id board.cell.21
expect A run must stay in one row or column.
expect Row 5, column 2, empty
# Undo takes back a whole run at once.
tap-id undo
expect Row 3, column 1, empty
expect 1/25
tap-id board.cell.10
tap-id board.cell.14
expect 6/25
# Guided names a line whose marks no longer fit its clues.
tap-id board.cell.0
tap-id board.cell.1
expect Contradiction in row 1.
clean
shot nonograms-guided
tap-id undo
expect-missing Contradiction
tap-id more
tap Run entry
tap Guided
tap Back
# With Guided off the same marks pass without a warning.
tap-id board.cell.0
expect-missing Contradiction
tap-id undo
# A picture this small is whole on the panel, so there is nothing to pan.
expect-missing Left
expect-missing Down
# Restart asks first, and Resume keeps the marks.
tap-id more
tap Restart puzzle
expect Restart puzzle?
expect Clear every mark. You can undo this.
clean
shot nonograms-restart-confirm
tap Resume
expect 6/25
tap-id more
tap Restart puzzle
tap-id confirm-reset
expect 0/25
tap-id undo
expect 6/25
# A failed save holds the marks and offers a retry.
scenario storage-full
tap-id board.cell.6
wait-idle
clean
shot nonograms-save-failed-board
expect Not saved · More to retry
tap-id more
expect Not saved
expect Retry save
clean
shot nonograms-save-refused
scenario normal
tap Retry save
wait-idle
expect-missing Not saved
expect Guided
tap Back
# Marks and their undo history survive closing the app.
restart
wait-for Nonograms
tap-paged House
wait-for-id more
expect 7/25
expect Row 2, column 2, filled
tap-id undo
expect 6/25
tap-id more
clean
shot nonograms-resumed-options
tap Back
tap-id 4294967295
expect Picture puzzles
